Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.53,0:24:35.54,SekkonSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,945)\fnFOT-TsukuBMDMin Std E-EN\fs120\fscx130\fscy120\c&HE2DFEB&}Os dois Números
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.04,SekkonSigns,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:12.63,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}I cannot believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:14.83,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}The world I used to know is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.03,0:04:20.03,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}I just woke up one day and everything changed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.63,0:04:25.03,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Zetsubou risou
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:29.83,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Yudanerare majiwaru sekai
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:31.83,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Are you excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:36.83,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Netsu obiru toiki jouki suru hoho
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:41.43,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Shisen no saki de kimi ga warau
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:45.43,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Namida ukabetemo sakendemo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:47.73,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Tomaranai shoudou
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:55.03,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Nigirishimeta yakusoku hanasanaide kimi wo kanjiru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:05:00.83,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Tsuranuite miseru yo kakujitsu na toko made
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:05.93,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Daremo shiranai michi no ryouiki nara oshihiraite
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:11.63,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&H1181F1&}Omoidasu yo tsuyoku mabushii hitomi wo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:17.33,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Daremo yaranai nara jibun de yaru shika nai
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:21.03,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Just gotta do it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:12.63,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Eu não posso acreditar nisso!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:14.83,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}O mundo que eu conhecia já não existe mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.03,0:04:20.03,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Um dia acordei e tudo mudou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.63,0:04:25.03,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Desespero, ideais...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:29.83,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}e um mundo entrelaçado que foi confiado a mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:31.83,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Você está animado?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:36.83,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Sua respiração está quente, suas bochechas estão coradas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:41.43,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Vejo você rindo em meus olhos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:45.43,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Mesmo se você chorar ou gritar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:47.73,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Não tem como parar este impulso.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:55.03,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Não deixe de lado a sua promessa, eu sinto sua presença.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:05:00.83,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Vou continuar até ter certeza.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:05.93,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Se é um território desconhecido, eu o abrirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:11.63,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&H1181F1&}Lembrarei desses olhos fortes e deslumbrantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:17.33,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Se ninguém o faz, eu mesmo tenho que fazê-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:21.03,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Só tem que ser feito.
